canon = "Ch6 (Keeper 2026-11-01, [C]): doors on silent hinges, a faint metallic smell of magic; the beast pads down a long hall, through polished wooden doors, to the long table laden with steaming food; plops into the oversized head chair, the wood groaning, and in a flash of white light turns into a golden-haired man (green tunic, baldric, gold mask). She presses against the panelled wall by the door. His first words after the change: You should eat something. Sit. Eat. (Keeper L86-31 [V]). An empty seat had been pulled out [V]; his magic sliding it out, green, is [A]/[X] owner. She refuses (first rule). The call into the dining room is wordless in canon (a growl, the doors swing wider); "In here." is [X]. Lucien strides in past her to the head of the table, furious a scrawny girl killed Andras. Alis takes her off to bathe. Invented (X): Lucien's and Alis's wording, the beast's "In here.", the chair line, the follow cue. Marks are in manor_dining_table's frame (anchor at world 21, floor, -31.5)."
